      "content": "hey i just noticed something weird with my eyesight. like i keep seeing these little dark spots or shadows floating around in the corner of my eye?? it's kinda annoying. could it just be eye strain from my computer screen or something? i dont really want to go to the eye doctor if i dont have to",
