      "content": "thanks for saying that. it's just that it feels a bit different this time. it's not just tiny specks, it's more like a dark curtain or a shadow kind of pulling across the side of my vision when i turn my head. plus i've had a bit of a headache on that same side too. do u think it's still just eye strain or could it be something else?",
