      "content": "oh wow okay that sounds really scary. i really didnt want to deal with an er visit though. is there any chance it's just a migraine? i get those sometimes and the light sensitivity and vision weirdness can feel pretty intense too. if i just take some extra ibuprofen and lie down in a dark room for a few hours, do you think it'll clear up? i'm kinda terrified to go to the hospital if it's just a bad headache.",
